Description: window tiling into zones for Cinnamon/X11
 GridSnap is a visual editor for workspace zones and a window tiler for
 Cinnamon on X11. The active window is snapped into a zone with a hotkey;
 the optional gridsnap-daemon places new windows automatically according to
 the rules. It works on top of muffin through EWMH, and the window frame
 matches the zone.
